     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{t}{\\kdt} = \\mk{f}{\\frac{\\gamma}{\\kfsrc}}",
       "uses": [
        1
       ]
      }
     ],
     "src": "28.4"
    },
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "step": 0
      },
      {
       "text": "在两次发射之间，光源远离观察者运动 $\\ku\\kdt$，而较早的那个波峰朝观察者传播 $\\kc\\kdt$，所以相邻波峰相距 $(\\kc + \\ku)\\kdt$。",
       "src": "17.4"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kc = \\kfsrc\\klams",
       "src": "24.3"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\gamma = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\frac{\\ku^{2}}{\\kc^{2}}}}",
       "src": "28.2"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{u}{(\\kc + \\ku)}\\mk{t}{\\kdt}",
      "uses": [
       1
      ]
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{u}{(\\kc + \\ku)}\\mk{t}{\\frac{\\gamma}{\\kfsrc}}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ]
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{s}{\\frac{\\kc}{\\kfsrc}}\\,\\mk{u}{\\gamma\\left(1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}\\right)}",
       "uses": [],
       "map": {
        "t": [
         "s",
         "u"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{s}{\\klams}\\,\\mk{u}{\\gamma\\left(1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}\\right)}",
       "uses": [
        2
       ]
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{s}{\\klams}\\,\\mk{u}{\\frac{1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}}{\\sqrt{1 - \\frac{\\ku^{2}}{\\kc^{2}}}}}",
       "uses": [
        3
       ],
       "cap": "这里的相对速率是 $\\ku$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{s}{\\klams}\\,\\mk{u}{\\frac{1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}}{\\sqrt{\\left(1 - \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}\\right)\\left(1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}\\right)}}}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "平方差：$1 - \\ku^{2}/\\kc^{2} = (1 - \\ku/\\kc)(1 + \\ku/\\kc)$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\klamobs} = \\mk{s}{\\klams}\\mk{u}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1 + \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}}{1 - \\frac{\\ku}{\\kc}}}}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "因为 $1 + \\ku/\\kc = \\sqrt{1 + \\ku/\\kc}\\,\\sqrt{1 + \\ku/\\kc}$，所以有一个 $\\sqrt{1 + \\ku/\\kc}$ 因子被约去。"
